va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "text", "x": 264, "y": 610, "w": 1015, "h": 40, "text": "أوراق المستويات وبطاقات العمل الجماعي في تبويبات الدرس", "size": 18, "color": "6B6B6B", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[الأنشطة المتمايزة] وزّع أوراق المستويات الأربعة وورقة أصحاب الهمم."}, {"bg": "F1F6FB", "els": [{"k": "shape", "x": 1130, "y": 560, "w": 260, "h": 260, "fill": "E6EFFA", "rad": true, "oval": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": -90, "y": -90, "w": 240, "h": 240, "fill": "E6EFFA", "rad": true, "oval": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 466, "y": 16, "w": 548, "h": 58, "text": "🌱 قيمَةٌ نَعيشُها", "size": 24, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "1F5FA8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 50, "y": 16, "w": 210, "h": 58, "text": "⏱ 4 دَقائِقَ", "size": 22, "color": "1E1E1E", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 86, "y": 92, "w": 1108, "h": 77, "text": "أُتْقِنُ كِتابَتي", "size": 34, "color": "14325C", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 90, "y": 175, "w": 300, "h": 400, "src": "resources/slides/img/AR-Y2-N-T1-L06-main.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": 410, "y": 175, "w": 360, "h": 180, "fill": "FFFFFF", "rad": true, "line": "1F5FA8", "lw": 3}, {"k": "text", "x": 425, "y": 180, "w": 330, "h": 46, "text": "🇦🇪 مِنْ سَنْعِ بِلادي", "size": 19, "color": "1F5FA8", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "text", "x": 425, "y": 228, "w": 330, "h": 120, "text": "أَكْتُبُ بِخَطٍّ واضِحٍ، وَأُراجِعُ ما كَتَبْتُ قَبْلَ أَنْ أُسَلِّمَهُ.", "size": 20, "color": "14325C", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 790, "y": 175, "w": 362, "h": 180, "fill": "FFFFFF", "rad": true, "line": "1F5FA8", "lw": 3}, {"k": "text", "x": 805, "y": 180, "w": 332, "h": 46, "text": "🏠 حَقيقَةٌ وَطَنِيَّةٌ", "size": 19, "color": "1F5FA8", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "text", "x": 805, "y": 228, "w": 332, "h": 120, "text": "يُشارِكُ طُلّابُ الْإِماراتِ في مُسابَقاتِ الْكِتابَةِ وَالْقِراءَةِ كُلَّ عامٍ.", "size": 20, "color": "14325C", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 410, "y": 370, "w": 742, "h": 90, "fill": "FFFFFF", "rad": true, "line": "1F5FA8", "lw": 3}, {"k": "text", "x": 425, "y": 375, "w": 712, "h": 80, "text": "🤔 انْتَهَيْتُ مِنْ فِقْرَتي بِسُرْعَةٍ وَأُريدُ أَنْ أُسَلِّمَها… ماذا أَفْعَلُ أَوَّلًا؟", "size": 22, "color": "14325C", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 475, "w": 742, "h": 110, "text": "✅ أُراجِعُها: أَجْزاءَها الثَّلاثَةَ، وَكَلِماتِها، وَعَلاماتِ التَّرْقيمِ، ثُمَّ أُسَلِّمُها.", "size": 20, "color": "0B5D3B", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "F2FAF4", "rad": true, "va": "middle", "rv": 1, "ff": "naskh"}, {"k": "text", "x": 330, "y": 612, "w": 620, "h": 44, "text": "🎯 كِتابَةُ فِقْرَةٍ", "size": 18, "color": "1F5FA8", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E6EFFA", "rad": true, "va": "middle", "ff": "naskh"}], "n": "[القيمة والسلوك والهوية] ناقش المعضلة، ثم اكشف الإجابة واربطها بالقصة."}, {"bg": "F1F6FB", "els": [{"k": "shape", "x": 1130, "y": 560, "w": 260, "h": 260, "fill": "E6EFFA", "rad": true, "oval": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": -90, "y": -90, "w": 240, "h": 240, "fill": "E6EFFA", "rad": true, "oval": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 466, "y": 16, "w": 548, "h": 58, "text": "💡 الدَّرْسُ الْمُسْتَفادُ", "size": 24, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "1F5FA8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 50, "y": 16, "w": 210, "h": 58, "text": "⏱ 3 دَقائِقَ", "size": 22, "color": "1E1E1E", "bold": true, "align": "center",